		<title type="html"><![CDATA[City of Austin Council Message Board • Item #6 (17 consultant contracts) pulled from consent]]></title>

					<category term="City of Austin Council Message Board" scheme="https://austincouncilforum.org/viewforum.php?f=2" label="City of Austin Council Message Board"/>
		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://austincouncilforum.org/viewtopic.php?p=4976#p4976"><![CDATA[
Colleagues,<br><br>I support Council Member Siegel in asking that this be pulled from consent. I cannot support Item 6 as it currently stands.<br><br>The community let us know how much full transparency means to them during this year's particularly difficult budget season, and as stewards of public money we need much more information about where this funding is going before we agree to it.<br><br>In service,<br><br>CMJV<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://austincouncilforum.org/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=721">Jose Velasquez</a> — Wed Sep 09, 2026 1:29 pm — Replies 1 — Views 232</p><hr />
]]></content>
